  "markdown": "# Authored translation protection fixture (not an official paper)\n\n## Abstract\n\n<a id=\"paper-5e96a3e5f9117941df782e04b7061fff90f2fc21309d0034101e17282daaafc9-p0001-c00001\"></a>\n\n这个由作者编写的测试夹具用于检验真实的翻译服务、受保护的代码与公式，以及源页面的一致性。它是一份受控的测试文档，而非科学发现。\n\n## 1 Method\n\n<a id=\"paper-5e96a3e5f9117941df782e04b7061fff90f2fc21309d0034101e17282daaafc9-p0001-c00002\"></a>\n\n翻译周围的说明文字，保持此内联代码和公式不变： `return x + 1` $x_1 + x_2$\n\n## 2 Protected spans\n\n<a id=\"paper-5e96a3e5f9117941df782e04b7061fff90f2fc21309d0034101e17282daaafc9-p0002-c00003\"></a>\n\n以下是源代码：\n```python\ndef forward(x):\n    # Keep this English comment unchanged.\n    return x + 1\n```\n\n<a id=\"paper-5e96a3e5f9117941df782e04b7061fff90f2fc21309d0034101e17282daaafc9-p0002-c00004\"></a>\n\n\\begin{aligned} f(x) &= \\frac{x^2+1}{2} \\\\ g(x) &= \\beta_1 + 0.98 \\end{aligned}\n\n<a id=\"paper-5e96a3e5f9117941df782e04b7061fff90f2fc21309d0034101e17282daaafc9-p0002-c00005\"></a>\n\n以下是一个 HTML 代码块：\n<pre><code>print(\"Keep English text unchanged\")\n# Do not translate this comment</code></pre>\n",
